{"id":"torrey:eye-the","source":"torrey","name":"Eye, The","slug":"eye-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"The light of the body — Mt 6:22; Lu 11:34.","refs":[["Matt",6,22,6,22],["Luke",11,34,11,34]]},{"text":"Made. — Pr 20:12.","refs":[["Prov",20,12,20,12]]},{"text":"Formed. — Ps 94:9.","refs":[["Ps",94,9,94,9]]},{"text":"Opens. — 2Ki 6:17; Ps 146:8.","refs":[["2Kgs",6,17,6,17],["Ps",146,8,146,8]]},{"text":"Enlightens. — Ezr 9:8; Ps 13:3.","refs":[["Ezra",9,8,9,8],["Ps",13,3,13,3]]},{"text":"Frequently fair — 1Sa 16:12.","refs":[["1Sam",16,12,16,12]]},{"text":"Sometimes tender — Ge 29:17.","refs":[["Gen",29,17,29,17]]},{"text":"Sometimes blemished — Le 21:20.","refs":[["Lev",21,20,21,20]]},{"text":"The apple or ball. — De 32:10.","refs":[["Deut",32,10,32,10]]},{"text":"The lid. — Job 16:16.","refs":[["Job",16,16,16,16]]},{"text":"The brow. — Le 14:9.","refs":[["Lev",14,9,14,9]]},{"text":"Seeing. — Job 7:8; 28:10.","refs":[["Job",7,8,7,8],["Job",28,10,28,10]]},{"text":"Winking. — Pr 10:1.","refs":[["Prov",10,1,10,1]]},{"text":"Weeping. — Job 16:20; Ps 88:9; La 1:16.","refs":[["Job",16,20,16,20],["Ps",88,9,88,9],["Lam",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"Directing. — Nu 10:31; Ps 32:8.","refs":[["Num",10,31,10,31],["Ps",32,8,32,8]]},{"text":"The light of, rejoices the heart — Pr 15:30.","refs":[["Prov",15,30,15,30]]},{"text":"Not satisfied with seeing — Pr 27:20; Ec 1:8.","refs":[["Prov",27,20,27,20],["Eccl",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Not satisfied with riches — Ec 4:8.","refs":[["Eccl",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Not evil thing to be set before — Ps 101:3.","refs":[["Ps",101,3,101,3]]},{"text":"A guard to be set on — Job 31:1; Pr 23:31.","refs":[["Job",31,1,31,1],["Prov",23,31,23,31]]},{"text":"Made red by wine — Ge 49:12; Pr 23:29.","refs":[["Gen",49,12,49,12],["Prov",23,29,23,29]]},{"text":"Grows dim by sorrow — Job 17:7.","refs":[["Job",17,7,17,7]]},{"text":"Grows dim by age — Ge 27:1; 1Sa 3:2.","refs":[["Gen",27,1,27,1],["1Sam",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Consumed by grief — Ps 6:7; 31:9.","refs":[["Ps",6,7,6,7],["Ps",31,9,31,9]]},{"text":"Consumed by sickness — Le 26:16.","refs":[["Lev",26,16,26,16]]},{"text":"Wore their phylacteries between. — Ex 13:16; Mt 23:5.","refs":[["Exod",13,16,13,16],["Matt",23,5,23,5]]},{"text":"Not to make baldness between. — De 14:1.","refs":[["Deut",14,1,14,1]]},{"text":"Raised up, in prayer. — Ps 121:1; 123:1.","refs":[["Ps",121,1,121,1],["Ps",123,1,123,1]]},{"text":"Cast, on the ground in humiliation. — Lu 18:13.","refs":[["Luke",18,13,18,13]]},{"text":"The Jewish women often painted — 2Ki 9:30; Jer 4:30; Eze 23:40.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,30,9,30],["Jer",4,30,4,30],["Ezek",23,40,23,40]]},{"text":"Often put out as a punishment — Jdj 16:21; 1Sa 11:2; 2Ki 25:7.","refs":[["Judg",16,21,16,21],["1Sam",11,2,11,2],["2Kgs",25,7,25,7]]},{"text":"Punishment for injuring — Ex 21:24,26; Le 24:20; Mt 5:38.","refs":[["Exod",21,24,21,24],["Exod",21,26,21,26],["Lev",24,20,24,20],["Matt",5,38,5,38]]},{"text":"Of the mind. — Mt 6:22,23.","refs":[["Matt",6,22,6,22],["Matt",6,23,6,23]]},{"text":"(Open,) of spiritual illumination. — Ps 119:18,37.","refs":[["Ps",119,18,119,18],["Ps",119,37,119,37]]},{"text":"(Anointing with eyesalve,) of healing by the Spirit. — Re 3:18.","refs":[["Rev",3,18,3,18]]}],"refCount":58}
